  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yYXNKdtq/minecraft-title.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252f2dwisp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bluesky-Follow-448DEE?style=for-the-badge&logo=bluesky&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Bluesky\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f2DWisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Xwitter-Follow-1A1A1A?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Xwitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCXzb8erNlBkcd6VmE4JWj2A?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&label=YouTube&labelColor=454545&color=E52D27&link=https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" alt=\"YouTube频道订阅数\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252f2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-Support-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/simple-grass-flowers?style=for-the-badge&label=Modrinth&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/551206?style=for-the-badge&label=CurseForge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&labelColor=454545&color=F1641E\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<h2>🌻 简介：</h2>\n<p>为草方块、菌丝土和灰化土添加了花朵、岩石、三叶草及其他兼容原版的细节装饰。 </p>\n<p>无需安装任何模组。</p>\n<p>如果你想要更低的草方块侧面，请在本资源包旁边安装我的另一个资源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易低草方块侧面</a>！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果你需要与 Bare Bones 兼容的版本，请改用安装此资源包。</a></p>\n<h2>🎨 我的所有作品：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp 重制版原版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwisps-colourful-wildflowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp 彩色野花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易花草</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones 花草</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易低草方块侧面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-full-block-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精致全方块草</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-nether-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠心下界砖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-rustic-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易复古玻璃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fraven-phantoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">渡鸦幻影</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-breeze-rod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的微风棒</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤔 常见问题：</h2>\n<p><strong>问：如何安装此资源包？</strong><br>\n答：请参阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-install-minecraft-texture-packs-4615399%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>问：你能移植到基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：我目前暂无移植到基岩版的计划。</p>\n<p><strong>问：其他人可以移植到基岩版吗？</strong><br>\n答：不可以，我不允许他人对我的资源包进行第三方移植。</p>\n<p><strong>问：你能添加这个功能吗？</strong><br>\n答：也许吧！在评论区留下你的建议，我们看看情况。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我发现了一个Bug！</strong><br>\n答：请将所有Bug反馈在评论区，我会尽快修复。</p>\n<p><strong>问：此资源包适用于 X 版本吗？</strong><br>\n答：已确认该资源包至少兼容至 <strong>1.15</strong> 版本。由于文件名的更改，它很可能无法在更早的版本上运行。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将其加入我的整合包吗？</strong><br>\n答：当然可以！你必须注明出处，且不能将我的作品据为己有。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/7c463234-3d14-4a86-9788-f3a6d45a2488.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
